{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21721","headline":"酬乐天喜邻郡 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天喜邻郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹇驴瘦马尘中伴，紫绶朱衣梦里身。\n符竹偶因成对岸，文章虚被配爲邻。\n湖翻白浪常看雪，火照红妆不待春。\n老大那能更争竞，任君投募醉乡人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}